From 4ad0c149df1ed50c8e3a873ea4641fcf95e0e1c9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:46:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Build 38 motion: choose one from these, the reveal's letters,
 the Blend's arrival, Seen on Picks (rules 1730-1733)

Owner-approved 2026-11-12 (CS-Term-Project mockups/journeys/motion/b66-motion.html clips 1, 3, 5, 6), web and iPhone.
One curve, cubic-bezier(.2,.7,.2,1); transforms and opacity only; Reduce Motion everywhere.

- 1730 "Choose one from these": ChooseShuffle (web) / ChooseShuffleView (iPhone) over Pitch's pill and
  Next fit and Tonight's run and Re-roll. Deal, riffle, a slowing light, the lift with % and title; about
  1.8s, a reroll about 0.9s; 1-7 films; tap skips; the pick is the existing one, set under the layer.
- 1731 The reveal: the name sets in letter by letter (460ms, 85ms apart) over the tilted PosterWall pushing
  in to 1.075; replaces the blur and ring. Reduce Motion: wall still, name fades in whole (400ms).
- 1732 The Blend: faces slide together, the % counts up (CountUp gains a delay), the italic band rises in.
- 1733 Seen on Picks: the card leaves left (320ms), the next rises into place (350ms, 50ms later); the
  scroll-snap track jumps with snapping off. Reduce Motion: a 200ms crossfade.

Amends rules 370, 1106, 1383 and 1567's checks for the new code paths. Swift not compiled here.
[ds-log: n/a motion only; no scoring, ranking or pick logic changed]

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
